# Settings window: Material 1040x700 at 440,205 (page column from x~772); Glass 860x620 at 530,230. Sidebar rows (Material, x=560): Appearance 335, Wallpaper 385, Desktop 435, Menu bar 485, Lock 535, Notifications 626, Focus 676, Windows 767, Displays 858.
# Click coordinates inside pages are not known in advance: those steps are MANUAL unless a keyboard path exists. Check in each look.
ipc panels settings accounts
wait 2
shot a1
note A1 Google/iCloud/Microsoft rows, synced times, drive rows as QML; no 'Install secret-tool / keyring' prompt unless QML shows it.
ipc panels settings calendar
wait 2
shot a2
note A2 same calendar subscriptions and default alert as QML.
ipc panels settings ai
wait 2
shot a4
note A4 AI page: models, 'key set' marks, chat count as QML.
ipc panels settings defaultapps
wait 2
shot a6
note A6 Default Apps: same terminal/browser/editor choices as QML.
# MANUAL: A3 switch one calendar subscription off then on: switch follows, calendars.json back to the original
